{
  "id": "Lyo.Pdf.Web.Components",
  "name": "Lyo.Pdf.Web.Components",
  "area": "Data",
  "tagline": "Reusable Blazor / MudBlazor components for PDF workflows: an HTML → PDF workbench, a PDF annotation workbench, and a low-level annotator (`LyoPdfAnnotator`) that lets end-users draw bounding-box…",
  "description": "Reusable Blazor / MudBlazor components for PDF workflows: an HTML → PDF workbench, a PDF annotation workbench, and a low-level annotator (`LyoPdfAnnotator`) that lets end-users draw bounding-box regions on a PDF and emit `PdfBoundingBox` payloads.\n\nTargets `net10.0`. Razor SDK with `FrameworkReference Microsoft.AspNetCore.App` and `MudBlazor` 9.3+.",
  "features": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Register with DI",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "services.AddPdfAnnotatorService(); // IPdfAnnotatorService -> BrowserPdfAnnotator\nservices.AddPdfAnnotatorInterop(); // LyoPdfAnnotatorController (scoped)"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "list",
      "title": "Components",
      "items": [
        "`HtmlToPdfWorkbench.razor` — paste HTML or upload an `.html` / `.htm` / `.txt` file, then convert it to a PDF via `IWebRendererService`.",
        "`PdfAnnotationWorkbench.razor` — wraps `LyoPdfAnnotator` and renders a live table of saved annotations and their extracted payloads.",
        "`PdfAnnotator/LyoPdfAnnotator.razor` (+ `LyoPdfAnnotator.razor.cs`, `LyoPdfAnnotatorResultsView.razor`) — drawing surface and result list. Exposes `AnnotationsChanged` and `AnnotationsSaved` callbacks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "title": "Annotator services",
      "items": [
        "`IPdfAnnotatorService` (`BrowserPdfAnnotator` implementation) — returns `IReadOnlyDictionary<string, PdfBoundingBox>` after the user finishes annotating a PDF supplied as `Stream`, `byte[]`, or file path (`AnnotateAsync` / `AnnotateFileAsync`).",
        "`LyoPdfAnnotatorController` — scoped controller used by the Blazor components.",
        "`LyoPdfAnnotationResult` — payload emitted per saved region: `Key`, `BoundingBoxSummary`, `ExtractionType` (`BoundingBoxText`, `KeyValue`, `Table`), `ExtractedText`, optional `KeyValuePairs` / `TableRows`, `KnownKeys`, `TableHeaders`, `YTolerance`, `KeyValueLayout` (`PdfKeyValueLayout`), `InferFormattingFlags` (`PdfInferFormattingFlags`), `KeyValueInferDelimiters`, `TableKeyColumnLabel`, `ColumnCount`, and `ColumnTexts`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "Dependency injection",
      "text": "Combine with [`Lyo.Pdf`](../Lyo.Pdf/README.md)'s `AddPdfService(...)` so the annotator can call into `IPdfReader.Text` for bounding-box driven extraction."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "Static assets",
      "text": "Browser scripts live under `wwwroot/scripts/`. Reference them from your host page or through the standard Razor class-library `_content/Lyo.Pdf.Web.Components/` path."
    }
  ],
  "links": [],
